  "description": "Erection of a single-storey detached outbuilding following demolition of the existing outbuilding.",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal, due to the inclusion of a primary living accommodation would fail to remain incidental to the enjoyment of the main house, which would harm neighbours' living conditions, in terms of increased noise and disturbance, and the character and appearance of the site and surrounding area, contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations), and Residential Extension Guidelines.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal, by reason of its size and siting within the rear garden, would constitute an overdevelopment of the site and would fail to appear clearly subservient to the host dwelling. As such, it would harm the character and appearance of the site and the surrounding area, contrary to Local Plan Policies CC1 (Context and Character), CC2 (Urban Design and Architecture), and SC7 (Residential Extensions and Alterations), as well as the Residential Extension Guidelines."
